  "body": "Dedicated RecommendationCard, TradeoffPanel, DecisionMemo and ReasoningSummary with strict supplied reports, complete values/evidence and current identity-only review requests.\n\nExact seven archives from passing source 2877396681b8f71a9ba8dc7a782ac4981b6ac70c: 107 unit cases, eight actual desktop/narrow Chromium journeys, 136 DOM stages, eight native keyboard readings, 16 PNGs and both strict installed consumers. Accepted source preserves the workflow and all three immutable candidates.\n\nNo computed recommendation, executed/published decision, internal model trace, public npm publication, physical-device or external MCP-host acceptance is claimed. Canonical evidence: docs/results/2026/11-10/decision-narrative-checks.md."
